# Every screen the title links on a desktop window: All Modes and each mode's
# screen (Journey, Challenges with a challenge sheet, Learn, Practice setup,
# Hosted Play), the Daily sheet started, paused by Escape, Settings and How to
# play from the pause sheet and back, left; Profile → Achievements; Settings
# (the game's options, reset progress confirmation cancelled); How to play.
# viewport 1280x800@1
until 600 Three Marks
frames 60
save tm-title
click All Modes. Learn
until 300 Choose a Mode
frames 10
save tm-modes
click Hosted Play. Head-to-head
until 300 not available in this build
frames 10
save tm-hosted
key Escape 1
until 300 Choose a Mode
frames 10
click Challenge. Constrained
until 300 Constrained goals for a sharp session
frames 10
click Ten-Second Slate. Ten seconds
until 300 Win with a 10s clock
frames 10
save tm-challenge-sheet
click =Cancel
frames 10
key Escape 1
until 300 Choose a Mode
frames 10
click Practice. Free play
until 300 Practice Setup
frames 10
key Escape 1
until 300 Choose a Mode
frames 10
click Daily. One shared seed
until 300 Date (UTC)
frames 10
save tm-daily-sheet
click =Start
until 600 =Undo
frames 120
key Escape 1
until 300 =Paused
frames 10
save tm-paused
click =Settings
until 300 Color palette
frames 10
save tm-settings-pause
key Escape 1
until 300 =Paused
frames 10
click =How to play
until 300 Your Controls
frames 10
key Escape 1
until 300 =Paused
frames 10
click =Leave match
until 300 Choose a Mode
frames 10
key Escape 1
until 300 Three Marks
frames 10
click Profile. Progress
until 300 Statistics
frames 10
save tm-profile
click =Achievements
until 300 Century of Marks
frames 10
save tm-achievements
key Escape 1
until 300 Statistics
frames 10
click =Settings #2
until 300 Color palette
frames 10
click =Confirm before placing (tap twice)
frames 10
click =Reset all local progress
until 300 cannot be undone
frames 10
save tm-reset
click =Cancel
frames 10
click =Confirm before placing (tap twice)
frames 10
save tm-settings
key Escape 1
until 300 Statistics
frames 10
click =How to play
until 300 The Goal
